## Task Pipeline — Required

Before writing any code or files, a task file MUST exist in `workflows/tasks/`.

**If `workflows/tasks/` is empty:**
1. Create `workflows/tasks/YYYY-MM-DD-descriptive-name.md` using the task file template
2. Only then proceed with implementation

**When work is complete:**
Run `/complete workflows/tasks/FILENAME.md` before starting anything new.

The only valid task record is a `.md` file in `workflows/tasks/`.
In-chat checklists, mental notes, and built-in task panels do not count.
